Rotate Animation :

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <style>
    .box {
      width: 150px;
      height: 150px;
      background: #3498db;
      margin: 100px auto;
      transition: 2s ease;
    }

    .box:hover {
      transform: scale(1.2) rotate(50deg);
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="box"></div>

</body>
</html>
=========================================>>


✅ :hover
Jab tum mouse ko .box ke upar le jaate ho (hover karte ho), tab yeh style apply hoti hai.

✅ transform:
Ye CSS property hai jo kisi element ka size, position, rotation, skew ya 2D/3D transformation control karti hai.

⚙️ Details:
1. scale(1.2)
Box ka size 1.2x ho jaata hai.

Yaani original se 20% bada ho jaata hai.

Smooth zoom effect milta hai.

2. rotate(50deg)
Box clockwise 50 degrees ghoomta hai.

360° = full circle, toh 50° means thoda tilt.

Ye rotate hota hai center se by default.
